WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.600
Open Calendar from the sidebar.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.800
Drag the title bar to the top edge to make the window fullscreen.

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.100
Switch to Week to see the week at a glance.

4
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.200
Type an event in plain words in Quick add and press Enter.

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.100
CryoZen fills in the title, date, time, and place. Review it and click Create.

6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.200
The event lands on Thursday, next to the rest of the week.
